WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.817
I see students.

2
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:18.178
There are computers.

3
00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:26.499
I see magazines.

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:34.832
There are shelves.

5
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:43.148
I see posters.

6
00:00:43.149 --> 00:00:51.491
